    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Located on the edge of Stranorlar town in a residential cul-de-sac, this property offers all the benefits of town convenience yet enjoys a peaceful rural setting. Connected to all town services plus having an appealing mature wood at the end of the garden, this well maintained bungalow also has a large landscaped garden plus a double garage, a second storage shed and a car port, all of which adds to the appeal of this wonderful home. Internal accommodation comprise of sun porch, sitting room, kitchen/dining room, three bedrooms and a shower room. The present owner has carried out many improvements to this property in recent years and it now comes to the market with both house and grounds in first class condition. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Three bedroom detached bungalow<br><br>\nSun Porch/Entrance Hall - 4.75m x 1.75m <br>Three large picture windows overlooking front garden. \nWest facing.G\nFloor tiled.\nPatio doors leading to sitting room.\nRecessed lighting. \nRadiator.\nPVC front door with ornate glass panels and ornate side window. <br><br><br>\nMain Hall - 3.6m x 1.2m + (3.6m x 1.9m) <br>Laminate timber floor. \nPine ceiling. \nRadiator. <br><br><br>\nSitting Room - 4.2m x 3.7m <br>Fitted electric fire.\nLaminate timber floor.\nPlaster coving and ceiling rose.\nTwo radiators.<br><br><br>\nKitchen - 5.2m x 3.5m <br>High and low level kitchen units on three walls. \nElectric cooker with twin oven and four-ring hob - included.\nElectric extractor fan - included.\nFridge freezer - included.\nDishwasher - included.\nModern bowl and a half sink.\nLarge south-facing window.\nHotpress cupboard in kitchen.\nTwo ceiling lights.\nLaminate timber floor. \nTiled between units. <br><br><br>\nUtility - 1.8m x 1.2m <br>PVC rear door.\nFloor tiled.\nPlumbed for washing machine and tumbledryer - included.<br><br><br>\nBedroom One - 4.5m x 2.8m <br>Built-in wardrobe (3-door)\nLaminate timber floor.\nWindow overlooking rear garden. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Two - 3.7m x 3.2m <br>Wall-to-wall built-in wardrobe/drawer unit. \nLaminate timber floor. <br><br><br>\nBedroom Three - 3m x 2.7m <br>Built-in wardrobe unit. \nLaminate timber floor. \nWindow overlooking front garden. <br><br><br>\nBathroom - 2.5m x 2m <br>WC, WHB and large quadrant shower - electric power shower. \nWalls fully tiled. \nLinoleum flooring.\nHeated towel radiator fitted. <br><br><br>\nDetached Double Garage - 7.3m x 7.3m <br>Two vehicular access doors.\nWindows on three walls. \nPedestrian door. \nConcrete floor. <br><br><br>\nSecond Shed - 3.8m x 2.7m <br>Pedestrian door. \nSide window.\nConcrete floor. <br><br><br>\nRoofed Open-Sided Seating Area - 4.2m x 2.0m <br>Just outside back door. \nIdeal for morning coffee. <br><br><br>\nCarport - 4.2m x 3.8m <br>Just outside back door. \nConcrete floor. \nPerspex roof. <br><br><br>\nOutside WC - 1.8m x 1.8m <br>WC.\nStainless steel sink. \nRange of storage cupboards. <br><br>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Convenient location, close to Stranorlar town and all local amenities.\nSet on a large site with fully landscaped grounds, including secluded terraced gardens at the rear. \nA wooded area of mixed native trees, located immediately behind the site makes for a very appealing private setting. \nLow maintenance dashed exterior.\nTriple glazed windows throughout.\nTwo outbuildings - one detached double garage and one storage shed.\nCar port.\nDriveway leading around house.\nOil fired central heating.\nBeing sold with most contents included."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Viewing Details",
        "SortOrder": 6,
        "Content": "Strictly by appointment"
      }
    ],
